# Workspace Scope

All code changes, new files, and edits must stay inside this repository:

`h:\Projects\Ai Meter`

## Requirements

- Create, modify, and delete files only under this project root.
- Do not write to other directories on the machine unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer relative paths from the repo root (e.g. `src/...`, `.cursor/...`).
- If a task would normally touch files outside this folder, ask the user first or keep the work in-repo (e.g. config or scripts here).

## Examples

```text
✅ GOOD: h:\Projects\Ai Meter\src\app.ts
✅ GOOD: .cursor/rules/my-rule.mdc

❌ BAD:  h:\Projects\Other Project\file.ts
❌ BAD:  C:\Users\...\Documents\script.py
```
